{"content":[{"c":["AVEN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Term used by Ezekiel to describe On (Heliopolis), center of worship of the Egyptian sun god Ra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.30.17","r":"Ezek.30.17","rawR":"Ezek.30.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.30.17","value":"Ezek.30.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 30:17"},"). The Hebrew word ",{"c":["aven"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"}," (“wickedness”) was a play on the name On in a prophecy against the idolatry and wickedness of Egypt. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Heliopolis_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Heliopolis_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Heliopolis_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Heliopolis"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Epithet for Bethel (",{"href":"?bref=Hos.10.8","r":"Hos.10.8","rawR":"Hos.10.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.10.8","value":"Hos.10.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hos 10:8"},"), shortened from Beth-aven, “house of wickedness” (",{"href":"?bref=Hos.4.15","r":"Hos.4.15","rawR":"Hos.4.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.4.15","value":"Hos.4.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hos 4:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Hos.5.8","r":"Hos.5.8","rawR":"Hos.5.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.5.8","value":"Hos.5.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"5:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Hos.10.5","r":"Hos.10.5","rawR":"Hos.10.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.10.5","value":"Hos.10.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:5"},"). The prophet Hosea was condemning the northern kingdom’s idolatry, for which Bethel was one center (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.12.28-29","r":"1Kgs.12.28-29","rawR":"1Kgs.12.28-29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.12.28-29","value":"1Kgs.12.28-29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 12:28-29"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BethAven_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BethAven_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BethAven_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Beth-aven #2"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Valley where Syria was to be punished because of its transgression against the Lord (",{"href":"?bref=Amos.1.5","r":"Amos.1.5","rawR":"Amos.1.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.1.5","value":"Amos.1.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Am 1:5"},"), perhaps an oblique reference to Baalbek, the center of Syria’s Baal worship in the Beqa’a valley."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Aven","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ez 30:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.30.17","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.30.17","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.30.17"},{"anchorText":"Hos 10:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.10.8","rawQueryValue":"Hos.10.8","sourceRefExact":"Hos.10.8"},{"anchorText":"Hos 4:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.4.15","rawQueryValue":"Hos.4.15","sourceRefExact":"Hos.4.15"},{"anchorText":"5:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.5.8","rawQueryValue":"Hos.5.8","sourceRefExact":"Hos.5.8"},{"anchorText":"10:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hos.10.5","rawQueryValue":"Hos.10.5","sourceRefExact":"Hos.10.5"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 12:28-29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.12.28-29","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.12.28-29","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.12.28-29"},{"anchorText":"Am 1:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.1.5","rawQueryValue":"Amos.1.5","sourceRefExact":"Amos.1.5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"25f3953319241d507df4ecc7d3514587ef3ec082ec5e68b0658eeacc2280e292","sourceItemName":"Aven","sourceItemOrder":624,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Aven","product